# CITATION.cff — VAM-Coder
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VAM-Coder, please cite this software (and the associated manuscript when published)."
title: "VAM-Coder"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Clownfish"
    given-names: ""
version: "1.3E"
date-released: "2026-11-18"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  VAM-Coder is a repository-editing agent framework with Visibility Proof (VP),
  Selective Context Delivery (F), and Verified History Projection (S1) for the
  V13E flagship configuration. Dual-Token designs are exploration only and are
  not claimed as core contributions.
keywords:
  - VAM-Coder
  - V13E
  - Visibility Proof
  - selective context delivery
  - repository editing
  - context management
